<spell-notebook "components usage">
	<header level="1">
		Components
		<header>Components name a pack of another package's elements, which the root around them loads on demand, once per page.</>
	</>
	<components-tab-bar showing="usage"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#using-it">Using it</>
			<item link="#keyboard">Keyboard</>
			<item link="#accessibility">Accessibility</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- USAGE:  how to use it (attributes in practice, events, framework snippets), keyboard, accessibility. -->
	<section label="Using it">
		<markdown>Short how-to: what to write, which attributes matter, the events to listen for.</>
		<markdown>
			```js
			document.querySelector("ui-components").addEventListener("ui-changed", (event) => console.log(event.detail))
			```
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Keyboard">
		<markdown>Which keys do what.</>
	</>

	<section label="Accessibility">
		<markdown>What the shadow markup exposes, and what an author must add (`aria-label` ...).</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
